msgid ""
"Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum error "
"correction skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr ""
"Ambil peperiksaan 20 soalan di laman IBM Training untuk menguji kemahiran "
"pembetulan ralat kuantum anda dan terima lencana melalui Credly."

